  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile scvi_n200 RNA is strong, with avgpool and transformer nearly tied, while image-only resnet50 multiprofile avgpool is much weaker, leaving uncertainty about whether image features are complementary when fused with RNA. config_030 adds resnet50 image features to the strong RNA avgpool baseline using simple concat fusion, keeping profile, RNA encoder, image encoder, and aggregation aligned with existing unimodal baselines. This is the best next experiment because it directly isolates the effect of multimodal fusion with the only tested image encoder, avoiding confounds from untested ViT or transformer aggregation; if it improves over the RNA-only avgpool baseline, image is useful, and if not, resnet image can be deprioritized."
}

